%%center Each Strain twice.
%%begintext align
%% First figure single, and right Hands and left, then 
%% figure single with the next Cu. and right Hands and left,
%% then cast up 1st Cu. and change the Man into the Wo.
%% Place, then cast up at Top, and change again .| Then
%% you will be in your own Places, then right Hand and
%% left 'till you come below, then lead thro' the 1st Cu.
%% then you'l come right.
%%endtext
